{"page":272,"verses":[{"verse_key":"16:43","surah":16,"ayah":43,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَآ أَرْسَلْنَا مِن قَبْلِكَ إِلَّا رِجَالًا نُّوحِىٓ إِلَيْهِمْ ۚ فَسْـَٔلُوٓا۟ أَهْلَ ٱلذِّكْرِ إِن كُنتُمْ لَا تَعْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"[Prophet], all the messengers We sent before you were simply men to whom We had given the Revelation: you [people] can ask those who have knowledge if you do not know.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَآ","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"16:43"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَرْسَلْنَا","en_gloss":"We sent","transliteration":"arsalnā","verse_key":"16:43"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"before you","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"16:43"},{"pos":4,"ar":"قَبْلِكَ","en_gloss":"before you","transliteration":"qablika","verse_key":"16:43"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"16:43"},{"pos":6,"ar":"رِجَالًۭا","en_gloss":"men","transliteration":"rijālan","verse_key":"16:43"},{"pos":7,"ar":"نُّوحِىٓ","en_gloss":"We revealed","transliteration":"nūḥī","verse_key":"16:43"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِلَيْهِمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"ilayhim","verse_key":"16:43"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَسْـَٔلُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"so ask","transliteration":"fasalū","verse_key":"16:43"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَهْلَ","en_gloss":"(the) people","transliteration":"ahla","verse_key":"16:43"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلذِّكْرِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Reminder","transliteration":"l-dhik'ri","verse_key":"16:43"},{"pos":12,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"if","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"16:43"},{"pos":13,"ar":"كُنتُمْ","en_gloss":"you","transliteration":"kuntum","verse_key":"16:43"},{"pos":14,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"16:43"},{"pos":15,"ar":"تَعْلَمُونَ","en_gloss":"know","transliteration":"taʿlamūna","verse_key":"16:43"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٤٣","en_gloss":"(43)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"16:43"}]},{"verse_key":"16:44","surah":16,"ayah":44,"ar_uthmani":"بِٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ وَٱلزُّبُرِ ۗ وَأَنزَلْنَآ إِلَيْكَ ٱلذِّكْرَ لِتُبَيِّنَ لِلنَّاسِ مَا نُزِّلَ إِلَيْهِمْ وَلَعَلَّهُمْ يَتَفَكَّرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We sent them with clear signs and scriptures. We have sent down the message to you too [Prophet], so that you can explain to people what was sent for them, so that they may reflect.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"بِٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"With the clear proofs","transliteration":"bil-bayināti","verse_key":"16:44"},{"pos":2,"ar":"وَٱلزُّبُرِ ۗ","en_gloss":"and the Books","transliteration":"wal-zuburi","verse_key":"16:44"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَأَنزَلْنَآ","en_gloss":"And We sent down","transliteration":"wa-anzalnā","verse_key":"16:44"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِلَيْكَ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ilayka","verse_key":"16:44"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلذِّكْرَ","en_gloss":"the Remembrance","transliteration":"l-dhik'ra","verse_key":"16:44"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لِتُبَيِّنَ","en_gloss":"that you may make clear","transliteration":"litubayyina","verse_key":"16:44"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لِلنَّاسِ","en_gloss":"to the mankind","transliteration":"lilnnāsi","verse_key":"16:44"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"16:44"},{"pos":9,"ar":"نُزِّلَ","en_gloss":"has been sent down","transliteration":"nuzzila","verse_key":"16:44"},{"pos":10,"ar":"إِلَيْهِمْ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"ilayhim","verse_key":"16:44"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَلَعَلَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"and that they may","transliteration":"walaʿallahum","verse_key":"16:44"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يَتَفَكَّرُونَ","en_gloss":"reflect","transliteration":"yatafakkarūna","verse_key":"16:44"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٤٤","en_gloss":"(44)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"16:44"}]},{"verse_key":"16:45","surah":16,"ayah":45,"ar_uthmani":"أَفَأَمِنَ ٱلَّذِينَ مَكَرُوا۟ ٱلسَّيِّـَٔاتِ أَن يَخْسِفَ ٱللَّهُ بِهِمُ ٱلْأَرْضَ أَوْ يَأْتِيَهُمُ ٱلْعَذَابُ مِنْ حَيْثُ لَا يَشْعُرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Are those who plan evil so sure that God will not make the earth swallow them up, that punishment will not come on them from some unimagined direction,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَفَأَمِنَ","en_gloss":"Do then feel secure","transliteration":"afa-amina","verse_key":"16:45"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"16:45"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مَكَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"plotted","transliteration":"makarū","verse_key":"16:45"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلسَّيِّـَٔاتِ","en_gloss":"the evil deeds","transliteration":"l-sayiāti","verse_key":"16:45"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"16:45"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَخْسِفَ","en_gloss":"Allah will cave","transliteration":"yakhsifa","verse_key":"16:45"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah will cave","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"16:45"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بِهِمُ","en_gloss":"with them","transliteration":"bihimu","verse_key":"16:45"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضَ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍa","verse_key":"16:45"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"16:45"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يَأْتِيَهُمُ","en_gloss":"will come to them","transliteration":"yatiyahumu","verse_key":"16:45"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْعَذَابُ","en_gloss":"the punishment","transliteration":"l-ʿadhābu","verse_key":"16:45"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"16:45"},{"pos":14,"ar":"حَيْثُ","en_gloss":"where","transliteration":"ḥaythu","verse_key":"16:45"},{"pos":15,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"16:45"},{"pos":16,"ar":"يَشْعُرُونَ","en_gloss":"they perceive","transliteration":"yashʿurūna","verse_key":"16:45"},{"pos":17,"ar":"٤٥","en_gloss":"(45)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"16:45"}]},{"verse_key":"16:46","surah":16,"ayah":46,"ar_uthmani":"أَوْ يَأْخُذَهُمْ فِى تَقَلُّبِهِمْ فَمَا هُم بِمُعْجِزِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"that it will not catch them suddenly in the midst of their comings and goings- for they cannot frustrate God-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَوْ","e